# =============================================================================
#  EAE.orch - Enhanced Audioconference Experience (CAE-USC V2.5)
#  Workflow Description Language v0.3, AIF V3.0
#
#  One Controller, one Module, which executes by exchange: the capture of the microphone array
#  of a meeting room, the geometry of the array and the Audio Scene Reference are given, then
#  the Audio Scene Descriptors are asked for. The User Agent offers each datum to its Port, by Data Type and Port Number, from
#  the device the App gave it (the devices are the App's):
#
#    "Capture"    the audio of the array, a channel for each microphone
#    "Array"      the Microphone Array Geometry: where each microphone is
#    "Reference"  the Audio Scene Reference
#
#  and presents what the Module gives:
#
#    Scene        the Audio Scene Descriptors: the speakers found, where each is and when it
#                 is active, and the enhanced audio of each
# =============================================================================

workflow EAE over 1CAE-EAE-V2.5-I01

on Start:

    ask Controller to start

    offer   Capture   (OSD-BAO-V1.5) from device "Capture"
    offer   Array     (CAE-MAG-V2.5) from device "Array"
    offer   Reference (CAE-ASR-V1.0) from device "Reference"
    ask     Scene     (OSD-BAS-V1.5)
    present Scene

on Stop:
    ask Controller to stop